======================================================================================================================
S1  [sympy] MOMENTUM MATCHING: the relative velocity of a daughter to its LOCAL pump
======================================================================================================================
    chain rule along the path (generic polynomial field): True;  dw/dt + (w.grad)u (free fall, pressureless pump, same g): residuals [0, 0, 0]
    antisymmetric part drops out of d|w|^2/dt: True;  d2|w|^2/dt2 = 4 w.T^2.w - 2 w.Tdot.w: True
    two-axis cone n1^2 = e2/(e2 - e1): n.T.n = 0 True, |T n|^2 = -e1 e2 True
    I(0) = 1.748038 (C4 = 1.748038);  beta I(beta) at beta = 1e4 -> 1.571467 (pi/2 = 1.570796);  kinetic/coherent area = 2
  [PASS] S1 [sympy] dw/dt = -(w.grad)u exactly (free daughter, pressureless pump, same gravity); d|w|^2/dt = -2 w.T.w (the vorticity drops out), so |w| falls monotonically in positive-definite strain; D'' = 2 delta (2|Tn|^2 - n.Tdot.n); on the cone |Tn|^2 = -e1 e2; I(0) = C4, beta I -> pi/2 (K4); the kinetic area is 2x the coherent (FP10's convention)
         measured: identity True; anti True; D'' True; cone True/True; I(0) 1.74804; beta I 1.57147; ratio 2
         reading:  Bose stimulation needs |w| = v_k with w measured against the LOCAL pump; in an expanding flow w only shrinks, so a daughter born on the resonance can never re-enter it there, and a seed can enter it at most once, from above

